                        "glosses": [
                            "A hanging or covering in front of a door."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8a262ca-7bd9-4690-9925-b92a0db2c0ad",
                                "sense_id": "a149fa35-d654-393b-abe3-c8a5fe60594c",
                                "text": "1 tapestry door-hanging,³ 6/8"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6b4356c-6c1a-44c1-a7de-b16ad198610d",
                                "sense_id": "a149fa35-d654-393b-abe3-c8a5fe60594c",
                                "text": "The Anteportaes [translating portiere] were of cloth of Gold of Burſia, and their borders of Crimſon Veluet, embroydered with Gold and Pearles: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16831fa8-bf84-402d-83fd-55174b4ceaa5",
                                "sense_id": "a149fa35-d654-393b-abe3-c8a5fe60594c",
                                "text": "payed Mr Pearse 6 10 0 / and for painting Anteport 3 10 0 / upholster Anteport 1 5 5"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdb0e5a6-d6fc-45b3-ba1d-bf3580a8a0f4",
                                "sense_id": "a149fa35-d654-393b-abe3-c8a5fe60594c",
                                "text": "[T]he magnificent ex-voto realized by José de Paez in 1751, […] depicts a richly furnished bedroom, including a luxurious bed with folding screens, a painted cloth anteport and a fine imported carpet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f33139f-7974-4cc7-8854-de926673164b",
                                "sense_id": "a149fa35-d654-393b-abe3-c8a5fe60594c",
                                "text": "Reparo, o ante puerta, que es una pared ante la puerta [a protective screen or anteport, which is in fact a wall in front of the door]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fffd858-7a53-3ec2-addb-cab8dc8b05ad",
                        "entry_id": "9e659932-f1dc-3aec-8250-fedb96d27669",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An outer or preliminary port, gate, or door."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d87b769-6d05-4a6b-aef6-e797c446ac48",
                                "sense_id": "0fffd858-7a53-3ec2-addb-cab8dc8b05ad",
                                "text": "Between the 5 large anti-ports are columns of enormous height and compass, with as many gates of brasse the worke and sculpture of Pollajuolo the Florentine, full of cast figures and histories in a deepe relievo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cc92aec-a503-4d44-8763-b1da726bcd02",
                                "sense_id": "0fffd858-7a53-3ec2-addb-cab8dc8b05ad",
                                "text": "The plans were prepared by the eminent engineer, Adolfo Guerard, and what is wanted at once is the construction of a canal, port, and anteport, up to at least seven and a half meters depth; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ccc0ca3-e8cd-41b6-ad4b-cdc694f0d1a9",
                                "sense_id": "0fffd858-7a53-3ec2-addb-cab8dc8b05ad",
                                "text": "In terms of the anteport material, the single-layer wooden door is usually used. However, some new buildings choose steel doors or metal insulation doors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
